NAME
    gcloud beta memorystore instances token-auth-users auth-tokens - manage
        Auth Token resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta memorystore instances token-auth-users auth-tokens COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) Manage Auth Token resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     delete
        (BETA) Delete authTokens.

     describe
        (BETA) Describe authTokens.

     list
        (BETA) List authTokens.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice. This
    variant is also available:

        $ gcloud alpha memorystore instances token-auth-users auth-tokens

